

  ┌─ Write over a branch of a remote ────────────────────────┐
  │ feat/git-workstation on origin is replaced by the one    │
  │ here. The push stops if the remote has moved since it    │
  │ was last read.                                           │
  │                                                          │
  │ ✕ the commits the remote holds and this repository read  │
  │   are written over                                       │
  │                                                          │
  │ runs                                                     │
  │ git push --force-with-lease=feat/git-workstation:a1b2c3… │
  │ origin feat/git-workstation                              │
  │                                                          │
  │ type feat/git-workstation to go on                       │
  │ ›                                                      ▌ │
  │                                                          │
  │  enter run it  esc cancel                                │
  └──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘



